   "updated_at": "2026-11-11T20:37:48Z",
   "body": "Scope revised by the operator on 2026-11-11 (body, title and labels updated by `cloud/docs-steward`, operator instruction): the Legacy theme keeps the accent hue slider; other themes have fixed colours and no slider; « Thème » becomes a sub-menu with a preview per theme, like the app-icon picker. The 10 presets are dropped unless the operator asks for them on the Legacy slider.\n\n**Blocked by #729 (LOT-188, theme engine and gallery)**: the sub-menu needs the engine and the `theme.json` themes. Set back to `status: ready` when #729 merges, or earlier if the operator wants the sub-menu built on the current Legacy-only screen.\n\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
